window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I was a patient man to the very core.</p> <p></p> <p>Always the number two to the man at the top… continuously playing the game.</p> <p></p> <p>I knew that biding my time would pay off eventually and then a winning bid at auction and it would all be mine.</p> <p></p> <p>I’d played the role that was expected of me and now it was my time to shine.</p> <p></p> <p>I could finally live the dream I’d always wanted.</p> <p></p> <p>I just never expected him; I never expected to lose…I never thought I’d fall for the boss, twelve years younger than me.</p>"; 
